  "display_title": "A Husband I Didn’t Expect",
  "description": "Gyeo-Ul has lucked into a marriage with a rich, handsome, and kind man. The catch? She has no idea how it happened. After an accident wipes out the past year of her memory, Gyeo-Ul finds herself living a life she doesn't recognize: Si-Hu Kang, her sworn enemy, is now her doting spouse, and he won't stop gushing over her. \n\n*“Wait, I have to share a bed with this guy? And kiss him, too?! Why does he keep saying he loves me?!”*\n\nSomething about this marriage doesn’t add up.\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
